res that “feel” wide– such as pictures of grand, sweeping landscapes– are taken with the long lenses associated with portraiture or wildlife photography. These images – and many others – are accomplished...</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.35mmc.com/31/08/2026/wider-horizons-making-panoramic-images/\">Wider Horizons &#8211; Making Panoramic Images</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.35mmc.com\">35mmc</a>.</p>"}, {"_source": "35mmc", "_id": "https://www.35mmc.com/30/08/2026/a-pleasant-session-of-photography-at-a-medieval-weekend/", "title": "A Pleasant Session of Photography at a Medieval Weekend", "link": "https://www.35mmc.com/30/08/2026/a-pleasant-session-of-photography-at-a-medieval-weekend/", "date": "2026-08-30", "_parsedDate": "2026-08-30T08:52:28+00:00", "thumbnail": "https://www.35mmc.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/000082930010-1-1024x969.jpg", "excerpt": "Our town put on a Medieval weekend, something I had not seen before, it seemed a good excuse to make some images on film. I visited over two days to be able to see different enactments, fortunately it wasn’t too busy allowing me to get some pleasant photos. Well I like them anyway, which is...", "content": "<p>Our town put on a Medieval weekend, something I had not seen before, it seemed a good excuse to make some images on film. I visited over two days to be able to see different enactments, fortunately it wasn&#8217;t too busy allowing me to get some pleasant photos. Well I like them anyway, which is...</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.35mmc.com/30/08/2026/a-pleasant-session-of-photography-at-a-medieval-weekend/\">A Pleasant Session of Photography at a Medieval Weekend</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.35mmc.com\">35mmc</a>.</p>"}, {"_source": "35mmc", "_id": "https://www.35mmc.com/29/08/2026/filmomat-photoplug/", "title": "Filmomat PhotoPlug", "link": "https://www.35mmc.com/29/08/2026/filmomat-photoplug/", "date": "2026-08-29", "_parsedDate": "2026-08-29T09:00:32+00:00", "t