ing that I can actually fit in my front pocket. The list of cameras that fall into that category is not small, but it is not large either. The only problem is, most of them are out of my budget or I am not willing... The post Mino", "content": "<p>Much like many people, I love small compact cameras. Especially something that I can actually fit in my front pocket. The list of cameras that fall into that category is not small, but it is not large either. The only problem is, most of them are out of my budget or I am not willing...</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.35mmc.com/27/08/2026/minox-35-pl-the-search-for-small/\">Minox 35 PL &#8211; The Search for Small</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.35mmc.com\">35mmc</a>.</p>"}, {"_source": "35mmc", "_id": "https://www.35mmc.com/26/08/2026/another-dunedin-museum/", "title": "Another Dunedin museum", "link": "https://www.35mmc.com/26/08/2026/another-dunedin-museum/", "date": "2026-08-26", "_parsedDate": "2026-08-26T09:00:42+00:00", "thumbnail": "https://www.35mmc.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/01-2-732x1024.jpg", "excerpt": "The Early Settlers Museum, Dunedin. The post Another Dunedin museum appeared first on 35mmc.", "content": "<p>The Early Settlers Museum, Dunedin.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.35mmc.com/26/08/2026/another-dunedin-museum/\">Another Dunedin museum</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.35mmc.com\">35mmc</a>.</p>"}], "count": 30, "updated": "2026-09-15"}
